<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><style>body{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#192b3b}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%}td,th{border:1px solid #888;padding:6px;text-align:left}th{background:#eee}.draftlabel{text-align:center;color:#a63232;font-weight:bold}</style></head><body><div class="draftlabel">DRAFT · FOR COMPANY SECRETARY REVIEW</div><h1>Meridian Precision Components Limited</h1><h2>NOTICE OF BOARD MEETING</h2><p class="muted" style="text-align:center"><b>FICTIONAL EXAMPLE — replace with verified company records</b></p><p>Notice is hereby given that the 5th meeting of the Board of Directors of <b>Meridian Precision Components Limited</b> is proposed to be held on <b>30 October 2026</b> at <b>11:00</b>, at <b>Registered Office: Plot D-14/2, MIDC Chakan Industrial Area, Pune</b>, in Physical mode, expected to conclude at 13:00.</p><p>Notice dispatch proposed/recorded: 20 October 2026 by Email.</p><p>The agenda and notes are enclosed. Directors should disclose relevant interests and confirm their attendance arrangements with the Company Secretary.</p><p><b>Draft dispatch checklist:</b> verify recipient list and delivery evidence; verify notice period under the Act, SS-1 and Articles; confirm VC details where applicable.</p><p style="margin-top:35px">By order of the Board<br><br>________________________<br>Company Secretary / authorised signatory<br>Plot D-14/2, MIDC Chakan Industrial Area, Phase II, Khed, Pune 410501, Maharashtra</p></body></html>